    icon: '<svg viewBox="0 0 24 25" fill="currentColor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 19.2498C13.9096 19.2498 15.7409 18.4912 17.0912 17.141C18.4414 15.7907 19.2 13.9594 19.2 12.0498C19.2 10.1402 18.4414 8.3089 17.0912 6.95864C15.7409 5.60837 13.9096 4.8498 12 4.8498C10.0904 4.8498 8.25909 5.60837 6.90883 6.95864C5.55857 8.3089 4.8 10.1402 4.8 12.0498C4.8 13.9594 5.55857 15.7907 6.90883 17.141C8.25909 18.4912 10.0904 19.2498 12 19.2498ZM12 21.0498C7.0293 21.0498 3 17.0205 3 12.0498C3 7.0791 7.0293 3.0498 12 3.0498C16.9707 3.0498 21 7.0791 21 12.0498C21 17.0205 16.9707 21.0498 12 21.0498ZM12 15.6498C12.9548 15.6498 13.8705 15.2705 14.5456 14.5954C15.2207 13.9203 15.6 13.0046 15.6 12.0498C15.6 11.095 15.2207 10.1794 14.5456 9.50422C13.8705 8.82909 12.9548 8.4498 12 8.4498C11.0452 8.4498 10.1295 8.82909 9.45442 9.50422C8.77928 10.1794 8.4 11.095 8.4 12.0498C8.4 13.0046 8.77928 13.9203 9.45442 14.5954C10.1295 15.2705 11.0452 15.6498 12 15.6498ZM12 17.4498C10.5678 17.4498 9.19432 16.8809 8.18162 15.8682C7.16893 14.8555 6.6 13.482 6.6 12.0498C6.6 10.6176 7.16893 9.24412 8.18162 8.23143C9.19432 7.21873 10.5678 6.6498 12 6.6498C13.4322 6.6498 14.8057 7.21873 15.8184 8.23143C16.8311 9.24412 17.4 10.6176 17.4 12.0498C17.4 13.482 16.8311 14.8555 15.8184 15.8682C14.8057 16.8809 13.4322 17.4498 12 17.4498ZM12 13.8498C11.5226 13.8498 11.0648 13.6602 10.7272 13.3226C10.3896 12.985 10.2 12.5272 10.2 12.0498C10.2 11.5724 10.3896 11.1146 10.7272 10.777C11.0648 10.4394 11.5226 10.2498 12 10.2498C12.4774 10.2498 12.9352 10.4394 13.2728 10.777C13.6104 11.1146 13.8 11.5724 13.8 12.0498C13.8 12.5272 13.6104 12.985 13.2728 13.3226C12.9352 13.6602 12.4774 13.8498 12 13.8498Z"/></svg>',
  },
  {
    title: 'Enhanced Security',
    copy: 'Secure your GraphQL services with advanced authentication, authorization, and rate-limiting features in Mesh.',
    icon: '<svg viewBox="0 0 24 25" fill="currentColor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4.6046 3.7933L11.9999 2.1499L19.3952 3.7933C19.5951 3.83773 19.7738 3.94897 19.9019 4.10867C20.03 4.26836 20.0999 4.46697 20.0999 4.6717V13.66C20.0998 14.549 19.8803 15.4242 19.4608 16.2079C19.0413 16.9917 18.4348 17.6597 17.6951 18.1528L11.9999 21.9499L6.3047 18.1528C5.56515 17.6598 4.95872 16.9919 4.53922 16.2083C4.11971 15.4247 3.90012 14.5497 3.8999 13.6609V4.6717C3.89994 4.46697 3.96978 4.26836 4.09789 4.10867C4.22601 3.94897 4.40475 3.83773 4.6046 3.7933ZM5.6999 5.3935V13.66C5.69991 14.2526 5.84622 14.8361 6.12584 15.3586C6.40546 15.8811 6.80974 16.3265 7.3028 16.6552L11.9999 19.7872L16.697 16.6552C17.1899 16.3265 17.5941 15.8813 17.8738 15.359C18.1534 14.8366 18.2997 14.2534 18.2999 13.6609V5.3935L11.9999 3.9949L5.6999 5.3935Z"/></svg>',
  },
];
const faq = [
  {
    q: 'What is GraphQL Mesh?',
    a: 'GraphQL Mesh is a framework for building GraphQL gateways over GraphQL and non-GraphQL sources. You can compose REST/OpenAPI, gRPC, SOAP, databases, and GraphQL APIs into one supergraph, then query them with GraphQL. See the <a href="/graphql/mesh/v1">v1 introduction</a> for the current architecture.',
  },
  {
    q: 'What is the difference between Mesh Compose and Hive Gateway?',
    a: '<a href="/graphql/mesh/v1/getting-started">Mesh Compose</a> turns your sources into a supergraph. <a href="https://the-guild.dev/graphql/hive/docs/gateway">Hive Gateway</a> serves that supergraph (or one from Hive or Apollo GraphOS) with auth, caching, rate limiting, and observability. You can also serve a Mesh supergraph with <a href="/graphql/mesh/v1/consume-in-other-gateways">other Federation-compatible gateways</a>.',
  },
  {
    q: 'Should I use Mesh v0 or v1?',
    a: 'Use <a href="/graphql/mesh/v1">Mesh v1</a> for new work. v0 is the legacy runtime still documented under <a href="/graphql/mesh/docs">Mesh v0 docs</a>. If you are on v0, follow the <a href="/graphql/mesh/v1/migration-from-v0">migration guide</a>.',
  },
  {
    q: 'Can I expose REST or OpenAPI as GraphQL?',
    a: 'Yes. Mesh Compose can load OpenAPI/Swagger and JSON Schema sources and emit GraphQL subgraphs you can query, transform, and merge. Start with <a href="/graphql/mesh/v1/source-handlers">source handlers</a> and the <a href="/graphql/mesh/v1/source-handlers/openapi">OpenAPI handler</a>.',
  },
  {
    q: 'Does GraphQL Mesh work with Federation?',
    a: 'Yes. Mesh Compose can produce Federation-compatible subgraphs and supergraphs, including from non-GraphQL services. You can register them in <a href="https://the-guild.dev/graphql/hive">GraphQL Hive</a> or Apollo GraphOS, or run them with Hive Gateway. See <a href="/graphql/mesh/v1/transforms/federation">Federation transforms</a> and <a href="/graphql/mesh/v1/type-merging">type merging</a>.',
  },
  {
    q: 'Can I use Mesh without deploying a gateway?',
    a: 'Yes. You can <a href="/graphql/mesh/v1/local-execution">execute the composed schema in-process</a> inside your Node.js app, or run Hive Gateway as a standalone proxy. Same compose output, different serving model.',
  },
  {
    q: 'How do I combine multiple APIs into one schema?',
    a: 'Compose each API as a source, then use <a href="/graphql/mesh/v1/transforms">transforms</a> (prefix, rename, filter, encapsulate) and <a href="/graphql/mesh/v1/schema-extensions">schema extensions</a> such as <code>@resolveTo</code> to link types across sources. The <a href="/graphql/mesh/v1/getting-started">getting started guide</a> walks through a full compose config.',
  },
  {
    q: 'How do I migrate from Mesh v0 to v1?',
    a: 'v1 splits compose (Mesh Compose) from serve (Hive Gateway) and uses a new config format. Follow <a href="/graphql/mesh/v1/migration-from-v0">Migrate to GraphQL Mesh v1</a> for a source-by-source mapping from <code>.meshrc</code> to <code>mesh.config.ts</code>.',
  },
];

const checkmark = `<svg fill="none" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" width="20"><path d="M16.667 5 7.5 14.167 3.333 10" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="square" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5"></path></svg>`;
const githubIcon = `<svg fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 .5C5.65.5.5 5.65.5 12c0 5.08 3.29 9.39 7.86 10.91.58.1.79-.25.79-.56v-2.17c-3.2.7-3.87-1.37-3.87-1.37-.52-1.33-1.28-1.68-1.28-1.68-1.05-.72.08-.7.08-.7 1.16.08 1.77 1.19 1.77 1.19 1.03 1.77 2.7 1.26 3.36.96.1-.75.4-1.26.73-1.55-2.55-.29-5.24-1.28-5.24-5.68 0-1.26.45-2.28 1.19-3.09-.12-.29-.52-1.46.11-3.05 0 0 .97-.31 3.17 1.18a11 11 0 0 1 5.78 0c2.2-1.49 3.17-1.18 3.17-1.18.63 1.59.23 2.76.11 3.05.74.81 1.19 1.83 1.19 3.09 0 4.41-2.69 5.38-5.25 5.67.41.36.78 1.06.78 2.14v3.17c0 .31.21.67.8.56A11.51 11.51 0 0 0 23.5 12C23.5 5.65 18.35.5 12 .5Z"/></svg>`;
const arrow = `<svg fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m15.755 11.1-4.828-4.828L12.2 5l7 7-7 7-1.273-1.272 4.828-4.828H4.8v-1.8h10.955Z"/></svg>`;
const diagonal = `<svg viewBox="0 0 155 125" fill="none" preserveAspectRatio="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M1 0.05V54.141C1 58.54 4.551 62.113 8.95 62.141L146.05 63C150.449 63.028 154 66.601 154 71V124.05" stroke="#4F6C6A"/></svg>`;
const sectionTitle =
  'group text-center text-4xl leading-[1.2] tracking-[-0.48px] text-balance md:text-5xl md:leading-[1.16667]';
const iconTile =
  'bg-green-1000 flex size-12 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-xl text-white [&>svg]:size-6';
const dot = (score: number) =>
  score === 2
    ? 'bg-green-800 border-green-800'
    : score === 1
      ? 'border-green-800 bg-[linear-gradient(90deg,var(--color-green-800)_50%,transparent_50%)]'
      : 'border-green-800';
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width" />
    <BaseHead
      description={description}
      image={withBase('/assets/mesh-example.png')}
      imageAlt="GraphQL Mesh"
      site={MESH_SITE}
      title="GraphQL Mesh"
    />
    <script
      is:inline
      type="application/ld+json"
      set:html={JSON.stringify({
        '@context': 'https://schema.org',
        '@type': 'SoftwareApplication',
        name: 'GraphQL Mesh',
        applicationCategory: 'DeveloperApplication',
        operatingSystem: 'Web',
        url: 'https://the-guild.dev/graphql/mesh',
        offers: { '@type': 'Offer', price: '0', priceCurrency: 'USD' },
        publisher: { '@type': 'Organization', name: 'The Guild', url: 'https://the-guild.dev/' },
      })}
    />
  </head>
  <body class="text-green-1000 bg-white font-sans [color-scheme:light]">
    <SiteNavigation logo={MESH_LOGO} />
    <main class="text-green-1000 light mx-auto max-w-360 overflow-hidden">
      <!-- Hero -->
      <div
        class="relative isolate mx-4 flex max-w-360 flex-col items-center gap-6 overflow-hidden rounded-3xl bg-blue-400 px-4 py-6 max-sm:mt-2 sm:py-16 md:mx-6 md:gap-8 lg:py-24"
      >
        <div class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 overflow-hidden" aria-hidden="true">
          <span
            class="absolute top-1/2 -left-40 w-[420px] -translate-y-1/2 text-white/30 md:-left-32 md:w-[520px] [&>svg]:w-full"
            set:html={meshMark('fill="currentColor"')}
          />
          <span
            class="absolute -right-56 -bottom-72 w-[560px] text-white/30 max-md:hidden md:w-[700px] [&>svg]:w-full"
            set:html={meshMark('fill="currentColor"')}
          />
        </div>
        <div
          class="relative flex size-24 items-center justify-center rounded-3xl border border-white/40 bg-gradient-to-br from-[#3B736A] to-[#15433C] text-[#A7D5CA] shadow-[0_12px_40px_-12px_rgba(0,52,44,0.6)] [&>svg]:size-14"
          set:html={meshMark('fill="currentColor"')}
        />
        <h1
          class="group relative mx-auto max-w-3xl text-center text-4xl leading-[1.2] tracking-[-0.64px] text-balance md:text-[4rem] md:leading-[1.1875]"
        >
          GraphQL Mesh
        </h1>
        <p class="relative mx-auto w-lg max-w-[80%] text-center leading-6 text-green-800">
          Unify your API landscape with Mesh’s federated architecture, integrating any API service
          into a cohesive graph. Part of the{' '}
          <a
            class="hive-focus underline decoration-green-800/30 underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-green-800"
            href="https://the-guild.dev/graphql/hive"
            title="Explore the Hive platform">Hive</a
          >
          {' '}ecosystem by{' '}
          <a
            class="hive-focus underline decoration-green-800/30 underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-green-800"
            href="https://the-guild.dev"
            title="Visit The Guild">The Guild</a
          >.
        </p>
        <ul
          class="relative z-10 mx-auto flex list-none flex-col gap-x-6 gap-y-2 text-sm leading-[21px] font-medium md:flex-row [&>li]:flex [&>li]:items-center [&>li]:gap-2"
        >
          <li><span class="text-green-800" set:html={checkmark} />Compose any API</li>
          <li><span class="text-green-800" set:html={checkmark} />Granular field access</li>
          <li>
            <span class="text-green-800" set:html={checkmark} />Works with any schema registry
          </li>
        </ul>
        <div class="relative z-10 flex flex-col justify-center gap-2 px-0.5 sm:flex-row sm:gap-4">
          <a
            class="text-green-1000 bg-primary relative flex items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-lg px-6 py-3 leading-6 font-medium text-nowrap hover:bg-white focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-1 focus-visible:outline-green-800/40 sm:w-fit"
            href={withBase('/v1/getting-started')}
          >
            <span class="absolute inset-0 rounded-lg border border-green-800"></span>Get started
          </a>
          <a
            class="text-green-1000 relative flex items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-lg px-6 py-3 leading-6 font-medium text-nowrap hover:bg-white/40 focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-1 focus-visible:outline-green-800/40 sm:w-fit [&>svg]:size-6"
            href={MESH_REPO_URL}
          >
            <span class="absolute inset-0 rounded-lg border border-green-800"></span><Fragment
              set:html={githubIcon}
            />GitHub
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Query anything, run anywhere -->
      <section class="px-4 py-6 sm:py-12 md:px-6 lg:py-24 xl:px-30">
        <h2 class={sectionTitle}>Query anything, run anywhere</h2>
        <ul class="mt-6 grid list-none grid-cols-1 gap-2 p-0 md:mt-16 md:grid-cols-3 md:gap-6">
          {
            infoCards.map(card => (
              <li class="bg-beige-100 rounded-3xl p-8 lg:p-12">
                <span class={iconTile} set:html={card.icon} />
                <h3 class="mt-5 text-xl leading-[1.4] font-medium">{card.title}</h3>
                <p class="mt-4 leading-6 text-green-800">{card.copy}</p>
              </li>
            ))
          }
        </ul>
      </section>

      <!-- Connect datasources -->
      <section
        class="bg-green-1000 mx-4 flex gap-8 rounded-3xl px-4 py-6 text-white md:mx-6 lg:p-8 lg:py-16 xl:gap-[72px] xl:p-[72px]"
      >
        <div class="lg:w-[400px] lg:shrink-0">
          <h2
            class="group text-4xl leading-[1.2] tracking-[-0.48px] text-balance md:text-5xl md:leading-[1.16667]"
          >
            Connect datasources
          </h2>
          <p class="mt-4 leading-6 text-white/80">
            Transform non-GraphQL services into GraphQL-ready interfaces with Mesh, enhancing API
            consistency.
          </p>
          <ul class="mt-10 flex list-none flex-col gap-6 p-0 lg:mt-12 lg:gap-8">
            {
              connectItems.map(item => (
                <li class="flex items-start gap-4">
                  <span
                    class="flex size-10 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-white/10 [&>svg]:size-6"
                    set:html={item.icon}
                  />
                  <p class="leading-6 text-white/80">{item.copy}</p>
                </li>
              ))
            }
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="flex flex-1 justify-center max-lg:hidden">
          <div
            class="grid h-[508px] w-full max-w-[600px] grid-cols-8 [grid-template-rows:repeat(5,auto)] text-sm"
          >
            {
              ['Mobile App', 'Web App', 'Node.js Client'].map((label, index) => (
                <div
                  class:list={[
                    'flex items-center justify-center self-end',
                    ['col-span-2', 'col-span-2 col-start-4', 'col-span-2 col-start-7'][index],
                  ]}
                >
                  <span class="rounded-lg bg-[#004540] px-3 py-2 text-center text-[#A2C1C4] xl:px-6 xl:py-3">
                    {label}
                  </span>
                </div>
              ))
            }
            <span
              class="col-span-2 col-start-2 row-start-2 [&>svg]:h-full [&>svg]:w-auto"
              set:html={diagonal}
            />
            <span class="col-start-5 row-start-2 w-px -translate-x-1/2 bg-[#4F6C6A]"></span>
            <span
              class="col-span-2 -col-end-2 row-start-2 justify-self-end [&>svg]:h-full [&>svg]:w-auto [&>svg]:[transform:rotateY(180deg)]"
              set:html={diagonal}
            />
            <div class="col-span-4 col-start-3 row-start-3 flex justify-center">
              <div
                class="flex flex-col items-center justify-center gap-4 rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-[#4F6C6A] to-[#004540] px-12 py-6 text-center text-[#A2C1C4] backdrop-blur-sm [&>svg]:size-16 lg:[&>svg]:size-20"
                set:html={meshMark('fill="currentColor"') +
                  '<span class="font-medium text-white">GraphQL Mesh</span>'}
              />
            </div>
            <span
              class="col-span-2 col-start-2 -row-end-2 [&>svg]:h-full [&>svg]:w-auto [&>svg]:[transform:rotateY(180deg)]"
              set:html={diagonal}
            />
            <span class="col-start-5 -row-end-2 w-px -translate-x-1/2 bg-[#4F6C6A]"></span>
            <span
              class="col-span-2 col-start-6 -row-end-2 justify-self-end [&>svg]:h-full [&>svg]:w-auto"
              set:html={diagonal}
            />
            {
              ['Books REST API', 'Authors gRPC API', 'Stores GraphQL API'].map((label, index) => (
                <div
                  class:list={[
                    'flex items-center justify-center self-start',
                    [
                      'col-span-2 -row-end-1',
                      'col-span-2 col-start-4 -row-end-1',
                      'col-span-2 col-start-7 -row-end-1',
                    ][index],
                  ]}
                >
                  <span class="rounded-lg bg-[#004540] px-3 py-2 text-center text-[#A2C1C4] xl:px-6 xl:py-3">
                    {label}
                  </span>
                </div>
              ))
            }
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- Live examples -->
      <section class="flex flex-col items-center px-4 py-12 sm:py-24 md:px-6 lg:px-12 2xl:px-24">
        <h2 class={sectionTitle}>See live examples in action</h2>
        <ExamplesSandbox border class="mt-8" />
      </section>

      <!-- Query anything -->
      <section
        class="bg-beige-100 text-green-1000 relative mx-4 overflow-hidden rounded-3xl p-4 pt-6 sm:py-24 md:mx-6 md:px-6 md:py-[120px] lg:px-12 2xl:px-24"
      >
        <span
          class="text-beige-300 pointer-events-none absolute right-0 bottom-0 w-[870px] translate-x-1/2 translate-y-1/2 [&>svg]:w-full"
          aria-hidden="true"
          set:html={meshMark('fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="0.4"')}
        />
        <h2 class:list={[sectionTitle, 'relative']}>Query anything</h2>
        <p class="relative mt-4 text-center leading-6 text-balance text-green-800">
          Bring every source into one graph: GraphQL and REST APIs, gRPC, SOAP, and databases.
        </p>
        <ul
          class="relative mt-8 flex list-none flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-3 p-0 lg:mt-16 xl:gap-x-6"
        >
          {
            datasources.map(source => (
              <li>
                <a
                  class="hive-focus group/item bg-beige-200 hover:bg-beige-300 block rounded-full px-4 py-3 font-medium transition lg:px-6 lg:py-4"
                  href={source.href}
                >
                  {source.name}
                  <span
                    class="ml-1 inline-block align-top opacity-65 transition group-hover/item:translate-x-px group-hover/item:-translate-y-px group-hover/item:opacity-100 [&>svg]:size-4 [&>svg]:-rotate-45"
                    set:html={arrow}
                  />
                </a>
              </li>
            ))
          }
        </ul>
      </section>

      <!-- Manipulate data -->
      <section
        class="bg-green-1000 relative isolate mx-4 mt-6 overflow-hidden rounded-3xl p-4 pt-6 text-white sm:py-24 md:mx-6 md:px-6 md:pt-24 lg:px-12 lg:py-[120px] 2xl:px-24"
      >
        <Image
          alt=""
          class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 -z-10 size-full object-cover object-right"
          src={manipulateBlur}
          widths={[720, 1440]}
        />
        <h2 class={sectionTitle}>Manipulate data</h2>
        <p class="mt-4 text-center leading-6 text-balance text-white/80">
          Transform and tailor your schema within Mesh to meet specific business requirements
          efficiently.
        </p>
        <dl
          class="mt-8 grid grid-cols-1 gap-4 divide-green-700 max-sm:divide-y sm:grid-cols-2 lg:mt-16 lg:gap-8 xl:grid-cols-4 xl:divide-x max-sm:[&>*:not(:first-child)]:pt-4 xl:[&>*:not(:first-child)]:pl-8"
        >
          {
            manipulate.map(([title, copy]) => (
              <div>
                <dt class="font-medium text-white">{title}</dt>
                <dd class="mt-2 leading-6 text-white/80">{copy}</dd>
              </div>
            ))
          }
        </dl>
      </section>

      <!-- Comparison -->
      <section class="px-4 py-6 sm:py-12 md:px-6 lg:py-[120px] xl:px-30">
        <h2 class={sectionTitle}>Consider switching from other tools?</h2>
        <p class="mt-4 mb-8 text-center leading-6 text-green-800 sm:mb-16">
          Learn the differences between Mesh, Apollo Federation, Hasura and GraphQL Tools
        </p>
        <div class="hive-focus overflow-x-auto" tabindex="0">
          <div class="w-fit overflow-hidden rounded-3xl border border-green-200 sm:w-full">
            <table
              class="w-fit text-sm sm:w-full sm:table-fixed [&_td]:border [&_td]:border-green-200 [&_td]:p-4 [&_td:first-child]:border-l-0 [&_td:last-child]:border-r-0 [&_th]:border [&_th]:border-green-200 [&_th]:p-4 [&_th]:text-left [&_th]:font-medium [&_th:first-child]:border-l-0 [&_th:last-child]:border-r-0 [&_tr:first-child>*]:border-t-0 [&_tr:last-child>*]:border-b-0"
            >
              <thead
                ><tr
                  ><th class="sm:w-1/4"></th>{
                    comparisonHeaders.map(header => <th class="sm:w-1/4">{header}</th>)
                  }</tr
                ></thead
              >
              <tbody>
                {
                  comparison.map(row => (
                    <tr class:list={[row.name === 'GraphQL Mesh' ? 'bg-green-100' : 'bg-white']}>
                      <td class="align-top font-medium">{row.name}</td>
                      {row.cells.map(cell => (
                        <td class="align-top">
                          <span
                            class:list={['mb-4 block size-4 rounded-full border', dot(cell.score)]}
                            aria-label={
                              ['not supported', 'partially supported', 'fully supported'][
                                cell.score
                              ]
                            }
                            role="img"
                          />
                          {cell.text}
                        </td>
                      ))}
                    </tr>
                  ))
                }
              </tbody>
            </table>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- Run anywhere -->
      <section
        class="text-green-1000 mx-4 mt-6 rounded-3xl bg-blue-400 p-4 pt-6 sm:py-24 md:mx-6 md:px-6 md:py-[120px] lg:px-12 2xl:px-24"
      >
        <h2 class={sectionTitle}>Run anywhere</h2>
        <p class="mt-4 text-center leading-6 text-balance">
          Deploy Mesh across any JavaScript environment, powered by its versatile Fetch API
          compatibility.
        </p>
        <ul
          class="mx-auto mt-4 flex max-w-[1200px] list-none flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-2 p-0 sm:mt-8 sm:gap-4 lg:mt-16"
        >
          {
            runtimes.map(([name, href, highlighted]) => (
              <li>
                <a
                  class:list={[
                    'hive-focus flex h-[72px] items-center gap-4 rounded-2xl px-4 font-medium transition-colors hover:bg-white sm:h-[102px] sm:px-6 md:px-8',
                    highlighted ? 'bg-blue-100' : 'bg-blue-200',
                  ]}
                  href={href}
                >
                  {name}
                  <span class="max-sm:hidden [&>svg]:size-6" set:html={arrow} />
                </a>
              </li>
            ))
          }
        </ul>
      </section>

      <!-- Extend the capabilities -->
      <section
        class="bg-beige-100 mx-4 mt-6 rounded-3xl px-4 pt-6 pb-8 sm:py-24 md:mx-6 md:px-6 md:py-[120px]"
      >
        <h2 class={sectionTitle}>Extend the capabilities</h2>
        <p class="mt-4 text-center leading-6 text-green-800">
          Expand your gateway capabilities robustly with Mesh plugins, tailored to your enterprise
          needs.
        </p>
        <ul
          class="mt-6 grid list-none grid-cols-1 gap-8 p-0 sm:mt-16 sm:grid-cols-3 sm:divide-x sm:divide-green-200 md:px-6 xl:px-16"
        >
          {
            capabilities.map(item => (
              <li class="sm:px-8">
                <span class={iconTile} set:html={item.icon} />
                <h3 class="mt-5 text-xl leading-[1.4] font-medium">{item.title}</h3>
                <p class="mt-4 leading-6 text-green-800">{item.copy}</p>
              </li>
            ))
          }
        </ul>
      </section>

      <!-- Ecosystem (shared Hive section) -->
      <ToolsAndLibraries class="mx-4 md:mx-6" />

      <!-- FAQ -->
      <section
        class="mx-4 my-6 flex flex-col gap-x-16 gap-y-6 px-4 py-6 sm:py-12 md:mx-6 md:px-6 lg:flex-row lg:py-24 xl:px-30"
      >
        <h2
          class="group text-4xl leading-[1.2] tracking-[-0.48px] text-balance md:text-5xl md:leading-[1.16667] lg:w-1/3 lg:shrink-0"
        >
          Frequently Asked Questions
        </h2>
        <div class="divide-beige-400 grow divide-y">
          {
            faq.map(item => (
              <details class="group/faq py-4">
                <summary class="hive-focus flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 rounded-md py-2 font-medium [&::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden">
                  {item.q}
                  <span
                    class="shrink-0 transition-transform group-open/faq:rotate-45 [&>svg]:size-5"
                    set:html={
                      '<svg fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg>'
                    }
                  />
                </summary>
                <p
                  class="pb-2 leading-6 text-green-800 [&_a]:font-medium [&_a]:underline [&_a]:decoration-green-800/30 [&_a]:underline-offset-2 hover:[&_a]:decoration-green-800 [&_code]:font-mono [&_code]:text-[0.9em]"
                  set:html={item.a}
                />
              </details>
            ))
          }
        </div>
      </section>
    </main>
    <SiteFooter description={MESH_FOOTER.description} logo={MESH_FOOTER.logo} />
  </body>
</html>
